{"id":"ddfeeeb445e33e71","group":"29","path":"29/29-thm-fo-star-free.md","title":"有序词上的 FO 刻画星自由语言","display":"thm-fo-star-free — 有序词上的 FO 刻画星自由语言","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Descriptive Complexity (Neil Immerman)","book_abbrev":"29","label":"29-thm-fo-star-free","aliases":["29-thm-fo-star-free"],"display":"thm-fo-star-free — 有序词上的 FO 刻画星自由语言","depends_on":["[[29-df-vocab]]","[[29-df-sentence]]","[[29-df-satisfaction]]","[[29-df-structure]]","[[29-df-struc]]"],"source_locator":"Theorem 1.37, p.22, DjVu scan 37","source_basis":"用户提供的 DjVu 文本层；核验范围见 Remark","revision_basis":"本次仅据用户提供的29(1).zip修订；既有原书定位及过往核对叙述为继承记录，未重新取得或查看DjVu原件","revision_verification":"数学类型与接口审查、静态结构及链接检查；未提交证明助理内核证书"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Descriptive Complexity (Neil Immerman)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"29"},{"key":"label","html":"29-thm-fo-star-free"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>29-thm-fo-star-free</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-fo-star-free — 有序词上的 FO 刻画星自由语言"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"28e86a5f0243a0ae\" href=\"?note=28e86a5f0243a0ae\" title=\"29-df-vocab\">29-df-vocab</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"711217f22972ffc0\" href=\"?note=711217f22972ffc0\" title=\"29-df-sentence\">29-df-sentence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"3ee556c64b16809b\" href=\"?note=3ee556c64b16809b\" title=\"29-df-satisfaction\">29-df-satisfaction</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"0ac4b9a122d458e2\" href=\"?note=0ac4b9a122d458e2\" title=\"29-df-structure\">29-df-structure</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"4de8e0c8085801f5\" href=\"?note=4de8e0c8085801f5\" title=\"29-df-struc\">29-df-struc</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_locator","html":"Theorem 1.37, p.22, DjVu scan 37"},{"key":"source_basis","html":"用户提供的 DjVu 文本层；核验范围见 Remark"},{"key":"revision_basis","html":"本次仅据用户提供的29(1).zip修订；既有原书定位及过往核对叙述为继承记录，未重新取得或查看DjVu原件"},{"key":"revision_verification","html":"数学类型与接口审查、静态结构及链接检查；未提交证明助理内核证书"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma\">\\(\\Sigma\\)</span> 为非空有限字母表；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\\mapsto P_a\">\\(a\\mapsto P_a\\)</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma\">\\(\\Sigma\\)</span> 到一元关系符号的单射，且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P_a\\ne&lt;\">\\(P_a\\ne&lt;\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"&lt;\\in\\mathsf R\">\\(&lt;\\in\\mathsf R\\)</span> 为固定二元关系符号。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau_\\Sigma=\\operatorname{vocab}(\\{&lt;\\}\\cup\\{P_a:a\\in\\Sigma\\})\">\\(\\tau_\\Sigma=\\operatorname{vocab}(\\{&lt;\\}\\cup\\{P_a:a\\in\\Sigma\\})\\)</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{vocab}\">\\(\\operatorname{vocab}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"28e86a5f0243a0ae\" href=\"?note=28e86a5f0243a0ae\" title=\"29-df-vocab\">29-df-vocab</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"w\\in\\Sigma^+\">\\(w\\in\\Sigma^+\\)</span> 作为长度为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n=|w|\\geq1\">\\(n=|w|\\geq1\\)</span> 的有限序列，位置集合为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n=\\{0,\\ldots,n-1\\}\">\\(n=\\{0,\\ldots,n-1\\}\\)</span>；下式定义其词结构 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak W_w\">\\(\\mathfrak W_w\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>FO 句子与满足关系见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"711217f22972ffc0\" href=\"?note=711217f22972ffc0\" title=\"29-df-sentence\">29-df-sentence</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"3ee556c64b16809b\" href=\"?note=3ee556c64b16809b\" title=\"29-df-satisfaction\">29-df-satisfaction</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varepsilon\">\\(\\varepsilon\\)</span> 为空词，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"LK=\\{uv:u\\in L,v\\in K\\}\">\\(LK=\\{uv:u\\in L,v\\in K\\}\\)</span> 为标准语言连接。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"&lt;_{n}\\coloneqq\\{(i,j)\\in n^2\\mid i&lt;j\\},\\qquad P_{a,w}\\coloneqq\\{i\\in n\\mid w(i)=a\\},\\qquad\\mathfrak W_w\\coloneqq\\iota W\\in\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\tau_\\Sigma]\\;\\left(|W|=n\\land&lt;^W=&lt;_{n}\\land\\forall a\\in\\Sigma\\;P_a^W=P_{a,w}\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[&lt;_{n}\\coloneqq\\{(i,j)\\in n^2\\mid i&lt;j\\},\\qquad P_{a,w}\\coloneqq\\{i\\in n\\mid w(i)=a\\},\\qquad\\mathfrak W_w\\coloneqq\\iota W\\in\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\tau_\\Sigma]\\;\\left(|W|=n\\land&lt;^W=&lt;_{n}\\land\\forall a\\in\\Sigma\\;P_a^W=P_{a,w}\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FinLang}(\\Sigma)\\coloneqq\\{L\\subseteq\\Sigma^*\\mid\\operatorname{card}(L)&lt;\\aleph_0\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FinLang}(\\Sigma)\\coloneqq\\{L\\subseteq\\Sigma^*\\mid\\operatorname{card}(L)&lt;\\aleph_0\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{StarFree}(\\Sigma)\\coloneqq\\bigcap\\{\\mathcal F\\subseteq\\mathcal P(\\Sigma^*)\\mid\\operatorname{FinLang}(\\Sigma)\\subseteq\\mathcal F\\land\\forall L,K\\in\\mathcal F\\;(L\\cup K,\\Sigma^*\\setminus L,LK)\\in\\mathcal F^3\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{StarFree}(\\Sigma)\\coloneqq\\bigcap\\{\\mathcal F\\subseteq\\mathcal P(\\Sigma^*)\\mid\\operatorname{FinLang}(\\Sigma)\\subseteq\\mathcal F\\land\\forall L,K\\in\\mathcal F\\;(L\\cup K,\\Sigma^*\\setminus L,LK)\\in\\mathcal F^3\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\bigl\\{\\{w\\in\\Sigma^+\\mid\\mathfrak W_w\\models\\phi\\}\\mid\\phi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\tau_\\Sigma}\\bigr\\}=\\{L\\cap\\Sigma^+\\mid L\\in\\operatorname{StarFree}(\\Sigma)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\bigl\\{\\{w\\in\\Sigma^+\\mid\\mathfrak W_w\\models\\phi\\}\\mid\\phi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\tau_\\Sigma}\\bigr\\}=\\{L\\cap\\Sigma^+\\mid L\\in\\operatorname{StarFree}(\\Sigma)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书 Theorem 1.37，印刷页 22、扫描页 37。已核对陈述；书中把完整证明引至 McNaughton–Papert，本次没有重验该外部证明。这里显式构造互斥且穷尽字母标记的词结构，并经 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"w\\mapsto\\mathfrak W_w\">\\(w\\mapsto\\mathfrak W_w\\)</span> 比较语言类，避免把全部关系结构上的查询集合直接等同于词语言集合。沿用原书非空词约定，右端限制到 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma^+\">\\(\\Sigma^+\\)</span>；空词的取舍不影响星自由性。BIT 不属于本词汇。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"29-df-vocab","status":"resolved","id":"28e86a5f0243a0ae","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-vocab]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"711217f22972ffc0","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-sentence]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-satisfaction","status":"resolved","id":"3ee556c64b16809b","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-satisfaction]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-structure","status":"resolved","id":"0ac4b9a122d458e2","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-structure]]","embed":false},{"target":"2